{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：15:00 2026-09-21 HKT</p>\n\n<p>「Ball場皇后」薛芷倫近日在社交平台分享飛抵新加坡度假，並大晒多張惹火靚相，旋即引來網民熱議。相中的薛芷倫現身高空無邊際泳池，悠閒地側臥於巨型獨角獸充氣浮床上，最吸睛莫過於她身穿一套極為大膽性感的雙色桃紅比堅尼泳衣，盡顯其豐滿上圍與白滑肌膚，腰間毫無多餘贅肉，一雙修長美腿更是毫無歲月痕跡，完全看不出她已經「登六」。</p>\n<h2>薛芷倫飛新加坡巡視業務</h2>\n<p>薛芷倫這趟新加坡之旅，除了在泳池大騷美好身材外，她隨後更親臨旗下餐廳「卅二公館」巡視業務。置身氣派不凡的奢華裝潢中，她一邊透過落地玻璃飽覽海景，一邊大啖餐廳的招牌美食，盡顯名店老闆娘氣派。薛芷倫懂得享受外，她更相當貼地，專程到新加坡老字號店舖購買班蘭蛋糕，不是一味的奢華生活。</p>\n<p>相閱閱讀：「Ball后」薛芷倫揭秘香港頂級上流飯局 全身CHANEL現身富豪會所不及奢華水晶餐桌搶眼</p>\n<img alt=\"有「Ball后」之稱的薛芷倫，早年經常出入Ball場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b5ee6febb020f74786461ec703538066/2023-02/fanny_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫是廣為人知的ball后。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/92d6e076513b4c46a87889668d652a10/2022-12/ball_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫已年過60歲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6108c9a1585c3010287ddffb30a2801/2025-06/BALL_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫身材好豐滿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb6cfb97ce2e7cd53825cf2753300f43/2025-06/BALL_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫一頭波浪金髮，配上精緻五官，狀態極佳，絲毫不似已經「登六」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/36a460b0a0ec05659d9dbacbb07a75ee/2026-09/SaveClip_App_794093415_18626846311005060_1436323245511874897_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近日薛芷倫身穿火辣比堅尼側臥獨角獸浮床，大晒傲人曲線與修長美腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc7bb5143139c1052e11901012c02dfb/2026-09/SaveClip_App_809039015_18626846278005060_3416047379085723653_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫親臨旗下餐廳Mott 32巡視業務。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/96fd20abe45d7cd76d671e59d69ae50c/2026-09/SaveClip_App_809209175_18626846296005060_5078008111673080593_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫品嚐招牌叉燒與星洲特色辣椒蟹等佳餚，相當懂得享受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03264b1cc8865e9c7c924d57e59e65b9/2026-09/SaveClip_App_809209201_18626846335005060_1082021764029900407_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫到訪的Mott 32裝潢奢華氣派，盡顯名媛老闆娘的生活品味。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/96dd8d2ebe66a32e21c66dff931e9471/2026-09/SaveClip_App_809876111_18626846332005060_4681896837066458117_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫歎香檳搭配新加坡經典班蘭蛋糕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b018fd187211413c730214ac216e07af/2026-09/SaveClip_App_813949065_18626846395005060_6699902361862561877_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫五官好立體。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d1c21568f02fdde5934df387d2d12a4/2022-12/319299024_877925283361667_736805210213675598_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫被指樣貌似芭比。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e3963543c8d5719567f84e0388aa78d9/2022-12/319340069_591761592757067_3906999531163110222_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫因為下巴尖，引來不少揣測。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4352077b1722e39031af5d67a8bc999e/2022-12/318639339_578890370712150_4491599109576274298_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫好喜歡穿粉姐色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fba2f60e6161b858308a0e9ffbdc5f21/2023-02/fanny_27.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫豐厚嘴唇及激尖下巴，正面睇個鼻好高。網民指已經走火入魔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3dc71ff364892815053d2e0f96b313b3/2023-02/fanny_25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫多年來被整容傳聞困擾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a0273a3d9a08a036009772f9836c28e/2022-12/312057898_543251197609401_8406279883190560153_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫對被指變臉，表示是患癌治療後的後遺症。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ee478feba8533b4760a9fe60b928088/2022-12/313864985_555859783015209_7520514420622552681_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫離婚後患上乳癌，導致雙重打擊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ad92693e5ee5e8878c2938127a011ae/2022-12/293049884_477548284179693_3555251216881276742_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2009年薛芷倫患乳癌，其後因病樣貌突變，卻被網民狂批變臉、整容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9bc572c607da4b4a3d1a1d5c6f4db286/2022-12/314177131_555859846348536_8867719654487523444_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫不時出席飯局。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c50e34b70838c9ea79e906e3ea0f3db/2026-02/Fanny_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫每次都盛裝打扮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/75f7c33c8cbea2629490344edec93584/2026-02/Fanny_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫早前出席「香港頂級私人會所晚宴」，與翁嘉穗同場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fcef5dfe4f36c85914255748d2845a26/2026-02/Fanny_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫分享場內裝潢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb94f9b163198f16ae43b17266500436/2026-02/Fanny_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫在私人會所打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0f583f65e028dedb5a74fa20cb68c7a/2026-02/Fanny_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫慶祝「登六」舉辦60歲生日派對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6728549912e21067c9c3a553f0ea1c4/2023-12/ballqueen_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫早前曾受傷，要用枴杖支撐身體。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07f328ff16c1dc2b8005c08b9c028a1b/2024-06/BALL_1_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>薛芷倫稱化療後遺症令面容改變</h2>\n<p>薛芷倫早年歷經豪門婚變，其後不幸罹患乳癌，在抗癌期間因接受化療而引發嚴重後遺症，導致容貌出現顯著變化，多年來屢被外界質疑「加工進化」，但她一直處之泰然，並大方解釋面容變化純屬化療後遺症，走過生死關頭的薛芷倫如今早已懶理世俗眼光，堅持活在當下，與網民分享最真實一面。</p>\n<p>相閱閱讀：61歲「變臉」名媛參加奢華派對躺500萬床褥打卡 穿睡衣紮孖辮擺誘人姿勢晒最強美腿</p>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫有「Ball后」之稱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24695ff9b06976fbcadc9b457d99414f/2022-12/319460247_676084934165842_4853217584198937250_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫近年活躍於社交網。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/481935a254d2ed0800f282a164f790e1/2022-12/252060064_185423633773323_350307126952251729_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫不時大晒富貴生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9605e2281a0b0a1f59655a140d986594/2022-12/ig_2_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫早前在IG分享近照，但照片變形。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de136083df122f17a5bd22d377f57e25/2025-06/BALL_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫大晒長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/268eb586605e63a60a1a4ca08a3efe70/2025-06/BALL_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫於1988年曾與羅霖前夫劉坤銘拍拖，可惜一年就分手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/605868b8f41051750fe1edde7bedf241/2022-12/xuezhilun.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫之後認識富商馬清偉，拍拖三個月便決定閃婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2f31a8656745463d2a65992e6d7b7d82/2022-12/husband_1_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫與富商馬清偉於於2003年婚姻破裂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b250080173b78891be1277a569cd7235/2023-02/fanny_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫離婚後曾與細19歲的衛蘭前男友拍拖，又被影到在夜店攬仔夜蒲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5891adc4e687caa769a2ef1b332daff3/2022-12/ball_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫為馬清偉誕下兩子一女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/857f48032ef1ca2692ff75b6726791eb/2022-12/301694617_504481701486351_6207237723980881324_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫2022年嫁女時勁大排場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95edfcf407989556f5bf55eb61169159/2022-12/husband_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馬清偉拖住馬桂珩出閣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b67fa4167512d90de4456f7db706dcc/2022-08/301049681_599152448490974_179404528276636617_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫一家人合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e29d5964ef8da4259f91d17581783129/2022-08/301176264_369141958588000_1075413952584532284_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馬桂珩身上好多金鈪，金光閃閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3703aeeaf3d7fefa16db3b06d2b8143d/2022-08/301109278_619426172857657_3465107361693599758_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫穿上睡衣參加派對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/12bf77814848e483dcec697b29409c0e/2025-07/Fanny_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫參加的派對好熱鬧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7cc52ba80dcf4400c3e94a2d00bdf206/2025-07/Fanny_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫紮起孖辮打扮減齡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3430952d4670b364e5a5dae8b3353229/2025-07/Fanny_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫帶Labubu去生日會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e34e21c1a38c3067b1603e5262edca2/2025-07/Fanny_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫選擇睡衣的款式，偏向保守。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/819bcb80b7d7645ac4f50ffbc43c8de1/2025-07/Fanny_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫打扮襯晒色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb8a79803960637e6e87698a628b4def/2025-07/Fanny_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫精心打扮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87f535e10d3d9d1f6ecb1a80610887b1/2025-07/Fanny_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛芷倫躺在百萬床褥上大晒長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8bcfaa40106f8629f1b9c65aa3a8b304/2025-07/Fanny_8_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T07:19:21.341877+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":582,"images":48,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}